*If a player has the poison status inside a POH, exiting the POH in any way will remove this debuff, removing the potential need to wait for death or a recovery pool.
*Player-owned houses are located inside pocket dimensions that were created by folding space.{{CiteNPC|npc=Estate agent|quote=It all came out of the wizards' experiments. They found a way to fold space, so that they could pack many acres of land into an area only a foot across. They created several folded-space regions across Gielinor. Each one contains hundreds of small plots where people can build houses.}}

